.TH AVR\-CACHE\-USAGE 1 "" "avr 0.3.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-cache-usage \- Show cache usage summary for a repository.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr cache usage
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show cache usage summary for a repository.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr cache usage --repo rep-abc123
    avr cache usage --repo rep-abc123 --json '*'
.fi
.RE
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    by_type, over_quota, quota_bytes, total_size_bytes
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (org/repo or rep-xxx). Auto-detected from git remote if omitted.
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-cache (1),
.BR avr-cache-delete (1),
.BR avr-cache-list (1)
